#: src-en/data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append:69
msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_WARP\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Name: Acidic Territory\n"
"Type: Neutral (Nebula)\n"
"Unique: False\n"
"Dominant Faction: The Acidic Growth\n"
"Rebel Threat Level: Low\n"
"\n"
"The Acidic Growth is a rather unknown faction - partly because of how protective they are of their space. Believed to be a form of hivemind or algae growth, The Acidic Growth have managed to construct their own technology to expand their borders beyond the nebulas it formed in."

